<title>SPAIN: One injured in Spanish bomb blast.</title>
<headline>One injured in Spanish bomb blast.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A car bomb exploded in the northern Spanish town of Bilbao on Friday evening, slightly injuring one person, police said.</p>
<p>Rebels of the ETA (Basque Homeland and Freedom) movement have stepped up their 30-year independence campaign this year.</p>
